---
layout            : null
# Jekyll's excerpt separator is a blank line, which falls inside the Liquid loop below and makes it warn on
# every build about a block it had to close for itself. This document has no excerpt to generate.
excerpt_separator : ""
---
{%- comment -%}
One file, at /sitemap.xml, which is the path crawlers probe unasked.

It lists this site's own pages and nothing else. It must never carry a demo URL: after the move those paths
301 to another host, and a sitemap full of redirects is what Search Console reports as an error.
{%- endcomment -%}
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">
  {% for page in site.pages %}
  {% if page.sitemap != nil and page.sitemap.exclude == false %}
  <url>
    <loc>{{ page.url | remove: "index.html" | absolute_url }}</loc>
    {% assign page_last_mod = page.sitemap.lastmod %}
    {% if page.sitemap.lastmod == "current" %}
    {% assign page_last_mod = site.time %}
    {% endif %}
    <lastmod>{{ page_last_mod | date_to_xmlschema }}</lastmod>
    <changefreq>{{ page.sitemap.changefreq }}</changefreq>
    <priority>{{ page.sitemap.priority }}</priority>
  </url>
  {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
</urlset>
